  "body": "## What to do\n\nChange the solidcore pin in `crates/kernel/Cargo.toml` (lines 30-37) from `55d0e7638` to `2016386442dfee3b2a0c3a1bfdd4017c5254dac8`.\n\n## Why\n\nThe fork `NeoTech/solidcore` was synced from its upstream on 2026-11-19. The sync brought 681 commits. The pin must follow the fork.\n\n## Scope\n\n- The pin affects only the kernel bench.\n- `Cargo.lock` changes with the pin.\n- If a solidcore API changed and the kernel does not build, record what changed. If the fix is more than a mechanical rename, stop and raise the effort label.\n\n## Gate\n\n- Run the `step_agreement` suite of the kernel. It must be green.\n- Run clippy for the kernel crate.\n\n## Done when\n\n- The pin is `2016386442dfee3b2a0c3a1bfdd4017c5254dac8`.\n- `step_agreement` is green on the new pin.\n",
